The '''Pokémon Paradise Resort''' (Japanese: '''ポケモンパラダイスリゾート''' ''Pokémon Paradise Resort'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in the [[Alola]] [[region]] on [[Akala Island]]. It appeared in ''[[SM086|I Choose Paradise!]]''. It is revealed to be a popular place, and thus, it is hard to get reservations.

In the episode, {{an|Lusamine}} was revealed to have reserved a place for the [[Ultra Guardians]]. {{Ash}} and {{ashcl}} took a boat to the Pokémon Paradise Resort, taking their [[Poké Ride|Ride Pokémon]] with them. While they were there, {{TRT}} attempted to steal their Pokémon but were defeated.

During the group's visit, {{an|Mallow}}'s friend {{an|Oranguru}} was revealed to be a regular customer at the resort.

==Care area==
The care area focuses on treating Pokémon. [[Kiawe's Charizard]] received treatment there courtesy of [[James]].

==Play area==
The play area consists of many locations where Pokémon and Trainers can relax and have fun, including a swimming pool, hot springs, two water-slides where Pokémon can go down in a raft, and a water volleyball net.

